# Double strike (CR 702.4) and melee (CR 702.121a): a 0/1 double striker attacking an opponent beside a 0/2 Ornithopter
# gets +1/+1 from its own melee trigger, so it is 1/2 and deals 1 twice, 2 damage. Without melee it would deal nothing, and
# without double strike only 1. The Mox Ruby and the Mountain pay {1}{R} exactly.

